  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“A secret to it, you say? Why no, I’ve always been this good.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Utility wild talent class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You treat the level of all utility wild talents have their effective spell level treated as ½ your kineticist level for determining their DCs.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Utility wild talents have their effective spell level treated as their level for determining their DCs.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
